  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allow uploading of props that aren't linked to avatars\n\nIE: \n\nspringjoint (ADHD) balls that can be loaded in without having to have them attached to avatars\n\nweapons and novelty toys such as throwable balls to play catch with\n\nFurniture (You're in a beach instance, you want to place a beach chair for photo opportunities)\n\nEspecially with the new share system being implemented, being able to share toys with your friends would be a rly great feature to encourage people to get vrc+",
